(
    title: "Looping",
    developer: Some("Ed Temple"),
    description: Some("Your plane cannot simply be steered — pulling the stick arcs it into a loop, and it flies fast enough that a misjudged one puts you into the scenery. Each level opens at an airfield you take off from, with a terminal to destroy, a missile, or both, and balloons bouncing across the runway. Beyond the airfield lies the Pipe Maze, a chain of rooms defended by dripping ooze, a bouncing monster, and three balls barring the door of the last one."),
